      en: ["The first national assembly of the Magyars was held here in 896 AD.", "The Feszty Panorama measures 120 meters in length and 15 meters in height.", "The park was officially established in 1970 to preserve national history.", "The Árpád Monument was unveiled in 1896 during the Millennium celebrations.", "The open-air museum features 19 building complexes showing rural life.", "Archaeological excavations revealed the foundations of a monastery from the 1000s."],
