      en: ["The palace complex contains a total of 126 lavishly furnished rooms.", "Joseph Haydn served as the court Kapellmeister here from 1766 to 1790.", "The current Rococo structure was constructed between 1763 and 1766.", "Empress Maria Theresa visited the palace in 1773 for a grand celebration.", "The building features a characteristic horseshoe-shaped architectural layout.", "The palace is part of the Fertő/Neusiedlersee UNESCO World Heritage site."],
