      en: ["The Szolnok Artists' Colony was officially established in 1902.", "It is located at the confluence of the Zagyva and Tisza rivers.", "The original studio buildings feature Neogothic and Romantic architectural styles.", "It is recognized as the oldest continuously operating art colony in Hungary.", "Famous founding members include Adolf Fényes and Lajos Deák-Ébner.", "The colony complex underwent major renovation for its centenary in 2002."],
