      en: ["The church was built in the late 13th century (around 1280)", "The 'smiling saints' frescoes were rediscovered in the 20th century", "The slender wooden spire was added in the 18th century", "The wall paintings reflect Byzantine stylistic influences", "Features a richly decorated painted wooden ceiling from 1777", "Key stop on the 'Route of Churches' cultural heritage trail"],
