      en: ["Construction of the castle began in 1416 by order of Filippo Scolari.", "The building features a regular square floor plan with a closed inner courtyard.", "Pipo of Ozora was one of King Sigismund of Luxembourg's most important military leaders.", "From the 18th century, the castle served as a granary for the Esterházy family.", "The building's reconstruction was recognized with an ICOMOS award in 2007.", "Valuable Gothic fresco fragments are preserved in the castle's chapel."],
