      en: ["The nature reserve spans an area of approximately 14,700 hectares", "More than 250 bird species have been documented in the area", "The wetland acts as a natural biological filter for the Zala River", "Kányavár Island is accessible via a famous triple-arched wooden bridge", "The site is an internationally protected wetland under the Ramsar Convention", "The nearby Kápolnapuszta Buffalo Reserve is the largest of its kind in Hungary"],
